/P 48 0 R
/E (The Global Sales and Financial Performance dashboard presents a consolidated view of commercial and financial activity through six headline indicators and several interactive visuals. The visible dashboard reports approximately 70.64 million in total sales, 25.12 million in total profit, 45.52 million in total cost, and approximately 300 thousand units of total quantity. It also displays an order count of approximately 100 thousand and an average sales value of 706.36. The dashboard is designed to help users examine performance from different perspectives. The line chart presents total sales by month, the horizontal bar chart compares employee-level profit, the column chart compares sales across product categories, and the doughnut chart shows the regional distribution of sales. A detailed product table provides item-level values for sales, quantity and profit-related measures.)
